  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Redevelopment of Lae Main Market</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;The redevelopment of the Lae&apos;s main market will deliver an upgraded, sustainable and fit-for-purpose market facility that is effectively and efficiently managed to provide better and improved access for all market users to sustain their livelihoods and well-being.&#xa0;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;ESIP (managed by Cardno ) is working closely with the Lae City Authority (LCA) to ensure a design for the market facility that fully addresses the following; capacity, accessibility, usability, safety and sustainability.&#xa0;&lt;/span&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
